  "description": "Post to social networks from a server: one channel contract (compose within each network's limits, pictures as native media with alt text or else a link card, tags, an idempotency key) and adapters for Bluesky (AT Protocol, app password, facets, images or an external card), Mastodon (instance token, Idempotency-Key, media), Discord (incoming webhook or bot channel, attachments or an embed), X (API v2 in user context, OAuth 1.0a or OAuth 2, media), Slack, Telegram, Threads (a text post with the link's preview, token renewal) and Facebook Pages (the feed, with the link). A post either lands with the network's URL and id or fails with a reason category; expected failures never throw. A retry after a lost answer re-reads before re-sending where the network allows. Credentials come from the host; the package stores nothing.",
  "id": "AgentKit.Social",
